@fn _scan_ident
@purpose Parses identifiers and dispatches to lookup_keyword to distinguish keywords.
@pre _peek() satisfies _is_alpha(). [src: lexer.aria:229-240]
@post Emits TkIdent or a keyword token (TkFn, TkIf, …); pos advanced past every alnum char. [src: lexer.aria:239]
@complexity O(k + d) where k = identifier length, d = keyword-table walk. [src: lexer.aria:229-240, token.aria:263-309]

