@fn _add_token
@purpose Appends a token with precomputed name to Lexer.tokens while preserving all other state.
@pre kind / text / start position are valid. [src: lexer.aria:115-131]
@post New Lexer returned with token appended; name computed once via token_name() so parser comparisons are O(1) string. [src: token.aria:136-139, lexer.aria:116]
@complexity O(1) amortized (append). [src: lexer.aria:123]

