@fn _newline
@purpose Consumes `\n`, resets col to 1, increments line.
@pre _peek() is `\n`. [src: lexer.aria:202-216]
@post pos += 1, line += 1, col = 1. [src: lexer.aria:202-216]
@complexity O(1). [src: lexer.aria:202-216]

