@fn terminates_statement
@purpose Predicate: can a newline after this token kind end a statement? Drives whether the main loop synthesizes a newline token.
@post Returns true for identifiers, literals, closing delimiters, and expression-terminating keywords (break, return, …); false for operators and openers. [src: token.aria:329-354]
@complexity O(1) — small chain of comparisons on token_name. [src: token.aria:329-354]

