@purpose Maps identifier text to a TokenKind; unknown strings return TkIdent.
@post Case-sensitive comparison — `fn` != `Fn`. [src: token.aria:263-309]
@complexity O(k) where k = keyword-table length (~40 checks). [src: token.aria:263-309]

